      "kind": "drawing",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data153/F207.html",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. His reference is Dominique Clévenot, Ornament and Decoration in Islamic Architecture (Thames & Hudson, 2000), page 148, figure 207: a pierced marble screen of Salim Chishti’s tomb, Fatehpur Sikri (1571), photographed by Gérard Degeorge."
    }
